<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
    
  </head>

  <body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <h2>Network Design and Configuration</h2>

    <p>
    In my networking course, I worked on designing
    and configuring a network using Cisco Packet
    Tracer. This included planning IP addresses,
    connecting devices, and testing communication
    between different networks.
   </p>

   <h2>Investra</h2>

   <p>
    Investra is a personal finance tracking website
    that I have been working on. It helps organize
    investment accounts, holdings, and transactions
    in one place.
   </p>

   <h2>Scorio</h2>
    <p>
    Scorio is a project I worked on to help students
    keep track of their assignments and deadlines.
    The goal is to make it easier for students to
    organize their schoolwork.
    </p>

    <h2>Canada Online Tutoring Website Review</h2>
    <p>
    I worked on reviewing the Canada Online Tutoring
    website and finding ways to improve its search
    engine optimization (SEO). My work included
    researching keywords, reviewing different pages,
    and suggesting improvements to website content.
   </p>

    <h2>2naturelle Website Optimization</h2>
    <p>
    I worked on improving website content and SEO
    for 2naturelle, an online skincare business.
    This included updating Shopify search listings,
    researching keywords, and writing skincare
    blog content.
    </p>


    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  </body>
  
</html>
